WEBVTT

00:06:57.038 --> 00:07:00.371
to try and collect samples that could
serve as proxies for human teeth.

00:07:00.413 --> 00:07:01.913
What would the enamel look like

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:04.038
of the people who were
living at La Isabela?

00:07:04.079 --> 00:07:05.871
Someone else got to go to Spain,

00:07:05.913 --> 00:07:07.788
but I rented a car, drove around,

00:07:07.829 --> 00:07:10.579
went into the mountains,
drove toward the river valleys.

00:07:10.621 --> 00:07:12.538
And of course, I went to a beach or two.

00:07:12.579 --> 00:07:14.329
And everything was going really well

00:07:14.371 --> 00:07:17.538
until the last day when I came
to what was supposed to be a bridge

00:07:17.579 --> 00:07:19.288
and saw a river and a herd of cows.

00:07:19.288 --> 00:07:23.871
So it was getting dark.
I was by myself. I was low on gas.

00:07:23.913 --> 00:07:26.746
And after I saw some cowboys
on the other side of the river

00:07:26.788 --> 00:07:28.121
kind of waving their hands,

00:07:28.163 --> 00:07:30.246
I just rolled down the window
and gunned it.